  "releaseNotes": "First stable release. Verified end to end against a running container, not only against the resource model: the pinned image pulls, Aspire starts it, every argument the package emits is accepted and acted on by the simulator, the OPC UA endpoint completes a protocol handshake, and the HTTP endpoint serves the OPC Publisher configuration. Fixes a defect found by that first real run — the HTTP endpoint was advertised but never listening, because --wp selects the port while only --sp starts the web server.",
